<title>HUNGARY: Borsodchem in shadow despite Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Borsodchem in shadow despite Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hungarian chemicals company Borsodchem Rt were overshadowed by MOL and Richter, despite Q1 results just out, traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>MOL shares rallied over eight percent after the $16.25 IPO pricing late Tuesday, while pharmaceuticals Richter also rose in heavy demand.</p>
<p>Borsodchem released first quarter results earlier today with its after-tax profit rising 3.9 percent according to HAS consolidated figures.</p>
<p>Other traders said earlier today that at first glance Borsodchem's results were average.</p>
<p>At 1055 GMT, Borsodchem shares stood at 6,610 forints, up 10.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
